22:38.790 --> 22:40.110
di kedai kecil awak.

22:41.070 --> 22:42.030
Maaf,

22:42.030 --> 22:43.310
kedai kami hanya jual mi,

22:43.310 --> 22:44.310
tiada lauk lain.

22:44.450 --> 22:45.420
Tiada lauk lain?

22:49.110 --> 22:50.350
Jika begitu, belilah di luar.

22:51.240 --> 22:52.070
Menara Mendaki Awan.

22:52.200 --> 22:53.910
Mereka tahu cita rasa kegemaran saya.

22:53.980 --> 22:54.780
